{"surah":110,"ayahs":["إِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">جَآ</span>ءَ نَصْرُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَتْحُ","وَرَأَيْتَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسَ يَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>خُلُونَ فِى دِينِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَفْوَاجًا","فَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَغْفِرْهُ‌ۚ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> كَانَ تَوَّابَۢا"]}